{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫戀綜《女神配對計劃2》幾位女神是非不斷，其中俞可程更被消失於節目中，相反阮嘉敏（Mandy）就成為零負評女神，她跟「短劇男神」吳旭東（東東）更被網民視為一對，並對他們甚為受落，節目未播完，兩人就以CP身份拍住搵真銀，「錢」途無限！</p><p>Man</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:35:01.580898+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T06:01:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T06:28:18.809934+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:28:18.809934+00:00","content_hash":"eebb802f897f6239074d49b725532c181a024e2b8eea46192aec92aa28b3ebf2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}